=== (3) deliberately-invalid snapshot injected: BOTH nodes NACK ===
    (SIGUSR1 pushes demo/invalid-snapshot.yaml raw; its route references
     a provider that does not exist, so each node's local validation
     REJECTS it. The wave HALTS and the fleet version does NOT advance.)
--- gatewayctl log: push + TWO nacks + HALTED (committed version frozen) ---
[2026-08-01T18:03:00Z INFO  gatewayctl] [inject] SIGUSR1: distributing raw snapshot demo/invalid-snapshot.yaml (942 bytes), BYPASSING the render gate — nodes are the validation authority
[2026-08-01T18:03:00Z INFO  gatewayctl::rollout] [rollout] trigger=sigusr1-raw pushing render_hash=ab597c93410d v=3 to 2 node(s): ["node-a", "node-b"]
[2026-08-01T18:03:00Z WARN  gatewayctl::server] [nack] node "node-a" NACKed v3: pushed config failed local validation; still serving local cfg=v2 (node keeps its prior version)
[2026-08-01T18:03:00Z WARN  gatewayctl::server] [nack] node "node-b" NACKed v3: pushed config failed local validation; still serving local cfg=v2 (node keeps its prior version)
[2026-08-01T18:03:00Z ERROR gatewayctl::rollout] [rollout] HALTED trigger=sigusr1-raw render_hash=ab597c93410d: the wave did not fully ack; fleet committed_version STAYS v2 (not advanced). 2 divergence(s):
[2026-08-01T18:03:00Z ERROR gatewayctl::rollout] [rollout]   divergent node node-a NACKed v3: pushed config failed local validation; still serving local cfg=v2
[2026-08-01T18:03:00Z ERROR gatewayctl::rollout] [rollout]   divergent node node-b NACKed v3: pushed config failed local validation; still serving local cfg=v2
--- node-a log: NACKed the bad snapshot, still serving its good version ---
[2026-08-01T18:03:00Z ERROR gatewayd::reload] [reload] REJECTED (NACK, trigger=push): new config invalid; still serving cfg=v2 hash=bd606cff84e0
[2026-08-01T18:03:00Z WARN  gatewayd::client] [cp-client] HASH MISMATCH: control plane advertised render_hash=ab597c93410d but the bytes it sent hash to bd606cff84e0; ACKing with the bytes' true hash (control plane will diverge)
[2026-08-01T18:03:00Z WARN  gatewayd::client] [cp-client] node "node-a" NACK v3: pushed config failed local validation; still serving local cfg=v2
[2026-08-01T18:03:00Z ERROR gatewayd::client] [cp-client] NACK reason: pushed config failed local validation; still serving local cfg=v2
